        "zh": "中国文明演化探索包 V1",
        "en": "China Civilization Evolution Package V1"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "聚焦唐→宋→元→明→清五个朝代的文化演化、制度演化与技术扩散三条探索链，验证『可探索、可追溯、时间空间锚定的历史知识网络』。",
        "en": "Focuses on the three exploration chains — cultural, institutional, and technological diffusion — across the Tang, Song, Yuan, Ming, and Qing dynasties, demonstrating a traceable, time-and-space-anchored historical knowledge network."
      },
      "seed_topic": "china_civilization_v1",
      "exploration_goals": {
        "zh": "搞懂唐→清的制度演化：科举如何孕育文官体系，又如何承续为明代内阁；并理解佛教本土化、理学—心学转折与郑和航海所代表的文化与技术扩散。",
        "en": "Understand the institutional evolution from Tang to Qing: how the imperial examination gave rise to the civil service system and continued into the Ming cabinet; and how Buddhist localization, the Neo-Confucianism-to-Mind-school turn, and Zheng He's voyages represent cultural and technological diffusion."
      },
